{"id":1775,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为增强毕业生党员的身份意识、责任意识和宗旨意识，引导全体毕业生党员铭记入党初心、永葆党员本色，2026年6月12日，机械工程学院在校史馆前举行“青春向党守初心，逐梦前行启新篇”毕业生党员政治生日主题党日活动。学院党委副书记李晓杰出席，全体支部书记及毕业生党员代表参加，活动由学院学生党建工作负责老师李唯主持。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozQ_knz9Yo7W7UFlUsMN7DU8LYMzV9VLz-aU47ZU4rVo7C0gihFp2hmCIa0USybM1yiU1hVoRTRM8lDL8lsLz9DLRM2nmQ7MlrRnR6kUNQFnmLsL4lanRAFM4lsL4vJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZoz9sgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A965BE89C7E63E718603FF6D5ECD7BBF/F37350D8/75737\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 500px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6LmV_7LzL8UNl4oF7lsn7CsnmUYozQ97LmTfM8lbL47ZMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZnkhfL1ybMRfkUmvZLmMfolLZUzGsL7-YU8-4nzlDUzQFUzlaMlC8UzTFM7-DUmG8gtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRNZMYbw62A8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动在《国际歌》中庄严开场。全体党员在院党委副书记李晓杰的带领下重温入党誓词，誓言铿锵，坚定了理想信念。毕业生党员代表郭子峤深情发言，表达将牢记初心使命，在新征程上勇担重任。随后，学院党委副书记李晓杰向毕业生党员代表赠送纪念名章，寄托组织的关怀与期望。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozM_foRrfo7-bLFNQ7MlQ2MRVRM7C9PLzvsnNnRL4UZM4U0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyZokh2okhRnm7ioz9YMN-bLz62nm-YLmlYnznRMm9bU8WFU4ARMmNDnmTFM7-DU4NJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZoz9sgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/088F8CF159826B917FF22252E4C689CB/C8C696F9/4B6C9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6M8V_7Um78LzMVUFNCPnzG4nmUZnmQ9RLRNiM7Canz7PozU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhRMSyaLSyaLmv4o7VfnzQfUzvinNLDnmLDLRTknlM2nz6FMzTkMN-ZnRfFLz7aLNligtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRNZMYbw62A8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动最后，学院党委副书记李晓杰肯定了毕业生党员在校期间的优秀表现，并寄语大家：要心有所畏，言有所戒，行有所止，以实际行动维护党员形象，擦亮青春底色。伴随中北大学校歌《再铸辉煌》响起，活动圆满落幕。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6LR9_DM7UboRWfnFzW7M4CbMznkozW9kL7-4n7-8MNLbLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPL1ysMkhRUzT2M8MkLRlsL4l8MRCbollsnlMVL4CYLlWFMlCbMRCaL8VFMNM7U4LJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZoz9sgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E1274CA9F7CB0573544699E7ECE3621B/5F94603A/6CDC3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"500\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6MRU_YnzQkMmM7LF7CbMlVfLR7DnNr97n7C4M8-ZL4n2MNl0gihFp2hmCIa0USyaLShfL1h7nz-sUmGPLzAkLzGso7LPnR9DMRLaU8-YLR6FMRGbU8U8UNnFLmCsoR7sgtXaQ4Oeo4x/_dTNp26mgDTJQty0Lz74Lky4oRNZMYbw62A8c&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;一审一校&nbsp;陈文涛</p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;二审二校 杨&nbsp;洋</p><p> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;三审三校 李&nbsp;唯</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=6ozQ_knz9Yo7W7UFlUsMN7DU8LYMzV9VLz-aU47ZU4rVo7C0gihFp2hmCIa0USybM1yiU1hVoRTRM8lDL8lsLz9DLRM2nmQ7MlrRnR6kUNQFnmLsL4lanRAFM4lsL4vJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPLzLag4LZoz9sgtA8pUAcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1130&nid=38987&e=.jpg"}